      "message": "So this works on my GMS device with both Lineage Contacts and Google Contacts, with a few caveats (I\u0027m not sure yet if they can be solved):\n\n- Google Contacts has the option to move a DAVx5 contact to a Google Account, but not the reverse.\n- Google Contacts refuses to create contacts in DAVx5 (and if it\u0027s the default, it requires you to select a Google Account as the default location before it lets you create the contact).\n- Google Contacts will allow you to edit an existing DAVx5 contact.\n- Everything works correctly with Lineage Contacts.\n- Other apps appear to work correctly as well.",
